WEBVTT

00:12.895 --> 00:14.999
<i>Once upon a time,</i>
<i>从前，</i>

00:14.999 --> 00:19.550
<i>there lived a naive
little plankton named Jack.</i>
<i>那里住着一个天真的人
名叫杰克的小浮游生物。</i>

00:19.550 --> 00:22.343
<i>Jack's Chum Farm had
dried up,</i>
<i>杰克的密友农场有
干涸，</i>

00:22.343 --> 00:25.136
<i>and he only had
one single farthing left</i>
<i>他只有
还剩一文钱</i>

00:25.136 --> 00:27.171
<i>to buy food at the market.</i>
<i>去市场买食物。</i>

00:27.171 --> 00:30.136
Fear not, Karen,
my clockwork wife.
不要害怕，凯伦，
我的发条妻子

00:30.136 --> 00:32.999
I will spend our
last farthing wisely
我将花费我们的
明智地最后一分钱

00:32.999 --> 00:35.447
and save us from starvation.
使我们免于饥饿。

00:35.447 --> 00:36.895
Mwah.
哇。

00:38.654 --> 00:39.964
Oh!
哦！

00:39.964 --> 00:42.171
Wah, wah, whee.
哇、哇、哇。

00:42.171 --> 00:44.274
Get rich now?
现在发财了？

00:44.274 --> 00:46.102
Magic bean?
魔豆？

00:46.102 --> 00:48.792
Only one farthing?
只有一文钱？

00:48.792 --> 00:50.205
Hmm.
唔。

00:50.205 --> 00:51.792
Ka-ching!
嘉庆！

00:57.136 --> 00:58.205
Ahh.
啊。

00:58.205 --> 00:59.895
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

00:59.895 --> 01:01.654
Ouch! Oh!
哎哟!哦！

01:02.999 --> 01:04.447
Oh!
哦！

01:05.757 --> 01:07.688
Oh, Karen.
哦，凯伦。

01:07.688 --> 01:10.205
I hit the jackpot!
我中大奖了！

01:10.205 --> 01:11.723
Thank King Neptune.
感谢海王星国王。

01:11.723 --> 01:14.688
Did you get plenty
of food and varnish?
你得到很多吗
食物和清漆？

01:14.688 --> 01:16.068
Better than that.
比那更好。

01:16.068 --> 01:18.861
I got a magical bean.
我得到了一颗神奇的豆子。

01:18.861 --> 01:20.033
What?
什么？

01:20.033 --> 01:22.205
What do you do, boil it?
煮了怎么办？

01:22.205 --> 01:23.757
You don't eat it.
你不吃它。

01:23.757 --> 01:25.654
It's magic.
这很神奇。

01:25.654 --> 01:29.240
Oh, Jack, I can't believe
you blew our last penny
哦，杰克，我不敢相信
你花光了我们最后一分钱

01:29.240 --> 01:31.516
on a stupid bean.
在一颗愚蠢的豆子上。

01:32.757 --> 01:34.412
I still need varnish,
我还需要清漆

01:34.412 --> 01:36.792
but I'm not gonna let you
go hungry.
但我不会让你
挨饿吧。

01:36.792 --> 01:38.136
Open wide.
敞开。

01:38.136 --> 01:40.826
I told you, you don't eat it.
我告诉过你，你不吃它。

01:40.826 --> 01:43.171
It's--
它是 -

01:46.309 --> 01:48.654
Well, I'm full.
嗯，我吃饱了。

01:51.930 --> 01:55.895
I told you so, Karen!
我告诉过你了，凯伦！

01:55.895 --> 01:59.861
There he goes--
anything to win an argument.
他就在那里——
为了赢得争论而做的任何事情。

01:59.861 --> 02:02.585
Whoa!
哇！

02:02.585 --> 02:04.274
Hmm?
唔？

02:04.274 --> 02:06.516
I don't care if they
are good for my heart.
我不在乎他们是否
对我的心脏有好处。

02:06.516 --> 02:09.516
I am never eating another bean.
我再也不会吃其他豆子了。

02:09.516 --> 02:10.757
Huh?
啊？

02:10.757 --> 02:13.136
"Ye Old Krusty Krab"?
“老蟹堡”？

02:13.136 --> 02:15.619
Maybe someone there
can make me rich.
也许有人在那里
可以让我变得富有。

02:18.205 --> 02:20.240
Sounds like someone
is choking to death.
听起来像某人
快要窒息而死了。

02:20.240 --> 02:22.240
Don't worry.
I'll save you!
不用担心。
我来救你！

02:25.861 --> 02:27.343
Honk. Honk.
鸣喇叭。鸣喇叭。

02:33.585 --> 02:34.723
Oh!
哦！

02:35.585 --> 02:37.136
Galloping goose flesh!
奔腾的鹅肉！

02:45.378 --> 02:49.033
I meant well, Karen!
我的本意是好的，凯伦！

02:49.033 --> 02:50.550
Yeesh.
是啊。

02:50.550 --> 02:52.930
Watch where you're pecking,
注意你啄的地方

02:52.930 --> 02:54.723
you foul-feathered freak.
你这个羽毛肮脏的怪物。

02:57.999 --> 02:59.585
What the--
什么是——

02:59.585 --> 03:00.826
huh?
嗯？

03:07.550 --> 03:09.861
Fee, fi, fo, fite.
费，fi，fo，fite。

03:09.861 --> 03:12.171
I smell the blood
of a Bottomite.
我闻到了血的味道
一个Bottomite。

03:13.999 --> 03:15.274
Oh?
哦？

03:15.274 --> 03:17.861
Oh, it's just you, SpongeGoose.
噢，只有你，海绵鹅。

03:17.861 --> 03:19.309
Whoo-hoo.
呼呼。

03:19.309 --> 03:21.309
I have to stop feeding you
people food.
我必须停止喂你
人们的食物。

03:24.481 --> 03:28.378
Be a good goose and lay
some Krabby Patties on me.
做一只好鹅并躺下
我身上有一些蟹肉饼。

03:28.378 --> 03:29.378
Huh?
啊？

03:31.481 --> 03:33.895
Magic harp, do your thing.
魔法竖琴，做你的事吧。

03:33.895 --> 03:36.826
♪ Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow,
ow, ow ♪
♪ 噢，噢，噢，噢，噢，
呜呜♪

03:36.826 --> 03:39.309
Yeesh. Horrible.
是啊。可怕。

03:42.378 --> 03:44.792
Whoa-oh-oh.
哇哦哦。

03:47.378 --> 03:48.930
Ow!
噢！

03:48.930 --> 03:50.964
Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！

03:50.964 --> 03:52.068
Huh?
啊？

03:52.068 --> 03:55.378
It's ready.
准备好了。

03:58.723 --> 04:01.205
Edible gold, edible gold,
edible gold.
食用金，食用金，
可食用的黄金。

04:07.068 --> 04:08.654
Huh? Ahh!
啊？啊！

04:09.999 --> 04:10.999
Ooh.
哦。

04:10.999 --> 04:12.723
Ahh.
啊。

04:13.792 --> 04:15.516
I'm rich!
我很有钱！

04:15.516 --> 04:18.068
Thank you, magic bean!
谢谢你，魔豆！

04:19.412 --> 04:20.550
Oh?
哦？

04:20.550 --> 04:22.688
Don't mind if I do.
如果我这样做的话，请不要介意。

04:22.688 --> 04:24.068
Huh?
啊？

04:24.068 --> 04:26.930
Who disturbs me inner sanctum?
谁扰我内殿？

04:28.447 --> 04:31.240
Crazy weather, huh?
疯狂的天气吧？

04:31.240 --> 04:32.826
Yipe!
哎呀！

04:32.826 --> 04:33.999
Argh!
啊！

04:36.378 --> 04:38.033
Got ya!
明白了！

04:38.033 --> 04:40.447
Whether you're caged
or whether you're loose,
无论你被关在笼子里
或者无论你是否宽松，

04:40.447 --> 04:43.274
I'll feed you
to me golden goose.
我喂你
对我来说是金鹅。

04:44.412 --> 04:46.723
No, not the goose!
不，不是鹅！

04:46.723 --> 04:48.930
No!
不！

04:55.343 --> 04:58.068
I'll have a
solid gold pipsqueak...
我会有一个
纯金点滴...

04:58.068 --> 05:00.654
in about four hours.
大约四个小时后。

05:01.550 --> 05:02.999
Peekaboo!
躲猫猫！

05:02.999 --> 05:04.171
What?
什么？

05:05.861 --> 05:08.585
Giddy up,
galloping goose flesh.
头晕目眩，
奔腾的鹅肉。

05:08.585 --> 05:09.792
Hya!
哈！

05:09.792 --> 05:10.964
Bleh!
哎呀！

05:12.240 --> 05:14.378
Huh? Whoa!
啊？哇！

05:33.171 --> 05:35.102
Abandon goose!
放弃鹅！

05:46.723 --> 05:49.378
I forgot geese can fly.
我忘记了鹅会飞。

05:51.550 --> 05:54.619
All right, enough
of this storybook stuff.
好吧，够了
这本故事书的东西。

05:54.619 --> 05:57.550
It's laser time, baby!
现在是激光时间，宝贝！

06:00.412 --> 06:03.171
Timber!
木材！

06:05.792 --> 06:07.895
Okay, you can keep the goose!
好吧，你可以留着鹅了！

06:12.205 --> 06:13.792
Oh, no.
哦，不。

06:13.792 --> 06:15.033
Karen!
凯伦！

06:15.033 --> 06:18.447
Jack, look what you did
to our house.
杰克，看看你做了什么
到我们家。

06:18.447 --> 06:20.688
I just slayed
a giant for you.
我刚刚杀了
对你来说是一个巨人。

06:20.688 --> 06:22.895
You want to lay off?
你想裁员吗？

06:27.378 --> 06:29.205
Oh.
哦。

06:31.309 --> 06:33.378
Delicious.
可口的。

06:33.378 --> 06:35.033
There you go.
就这样吧。

06:35.033 --> 06:36.723
Bon appétit, sir.
祝你胃口好，先生。

06:36.723 --> 06:38.516
You were right, darling.
你是对的，亲爱的。

06:38.516 --> 06:41.102
That bean was magic.
那颗豆子很神奇。

06:41.102 --> 06:42.240
Mwah.
哇。

06:42.240 --> 06:43.792
Aww.
哇。

06:45.309 --> 06:48.481
And what can I get
for you on this magical day,
而我能得到什么
在这个神奇的日子里为你，

06:48.481 --> 06:50.068
my good sir?
我的好先生？

06:50.068 --> 06:51.171
Ahh!
啊！

06:54.033 --> 06:59.102
Um, I'd like a double
gold patty combo, please.
嗯，我想要双份
金色肉饼组合，请。

06:59.102 --> 07:01.654
No shirt, no shoes,
没穿衬衫，没穿鞋子，

07:01.654 --> 07:04.964
no shell, no service!
没有外壳，没有服务！

07:04.964 --> 07:07.240
Take a hike, tiny.
去远足吧，小小。

去远足吧，小小。